{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50378","headline":"春日侍宴望海应诏 · 褚遂良","name":"春日侍宴望海应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从军渡蓬海，万里正苍苍。\n萦波回地轴，激浪上天潢。\n夕云类鹏徙，春涛疑盖张。\n天吴静无际，金驾俨成行。\n戈船凌白日，鞭石[耿]（秋）虹梁。\n电举[朝]（潮）宗外，风驱韩貊乡。\n之罘初播雨，辽碣始分光。\n麾城湛□□，□□□□□。\n同文渐边服，入塞伫歌倡。\n（据《翰林学士集》校改。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚遂良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}